{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deckbuilding goes in two-footed on football management!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the gaffer of a classic football team and embark on a nostalgic 20-year journey up and down the English football Divisions through the 1980s and 1990s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Game of Two Halves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your line-up and formations, and challenge the opposition in a fast-paced card battler with three points on the line in every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/extras/68c9bee4e3192af9177055d5a42c8466.poster.avif?t=1760952389\" aria-label=\"GIF showing part of a match. The player lays down a Heavy Press card on an action to tip the odds of a shot in the player&#039;s favour and score a goal.\" width=800 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/extras/68c9bee4e3192af9177055d5a42c8466.webm?t=1760952389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/extras/68c9bee4e3192af9177055d5a42c8466.mp4?t=1760952389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Move the Goalposts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only football game where getting cards is a good thing! Earn card packs by completing challenges. Combine cards to enhance your deck and bully the other team off the pitch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/extras/a54d7410c6ecd90d1a720eb42f089671.poster.avif?t=1760952389\" aria-label=\"GIF showcasing a hand of cards and the player combining two attacking cards to produce one stronger variant.\" width=800 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/extras/a54d7410c6ecd90d1a720eb42f089671.webm?t=1760952389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/extras/a54d7410c6ecd90d1a720eb42f089671.mp4?t=1760952389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Your Head in the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Route one? Tiki-taka? Counter-attacking? Refine skills and strategies in training to earn extra card packs and humble your opponents when Saturday comes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/extras/b4a4e83875810be7c774eaccb20c9103.poster.avif?t=1760952389\" aria-label=\"GIF showcasing a team training chalkboard. The board shows an Attacking Focused training session with Billy Matthews, and the board then flips over to show different intensities of player training available.\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/extras/b4a4e83875810be7c774eaccb20c9103.webm?t=1760952389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/extras/b4a4e83875810be7c774eaccb20c9103.mp4?t=1760952389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep Your Eye on the Ball</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your club, manage player transfers, scout and develop youth talent, and scrap for every place across four Divisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/extras/92b1bfee8afe0791c68d715c28e89be6.poster.avif?t=1760952389\" aria-label=\"GIF showcasing a sticker book of all available squad players for the 80/81 Oxford squad. The pages turn to show players available for transfer, with star ratings and prices.\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/extras/92b1bfee8afe0791c68d715c28e89be6.webm?t=1760952389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/extras/92b1bfee8afe0791c68d715c28e89be6.mp4?t=1760952389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Stuck In</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the entire club from your desk. Control the finances, talk with the press, and hire and fire backroom staff. Don't get too distracted by any retro games on the computer...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/extras/c5cb9814341ed5ca4cf9a78e0484e865.poster.avif?t=1760952389\" aria-label=\"GIF showing the CRT monitor of an old computer with club finances on display.\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/extras/c5cb9814341ed5ca4cf9a78e0484e865.webm?t=1760952389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/extras/c5cb9814341ed5ca4cf9a78e0484e865.mp4?t=1760952389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Big Game Player</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in some of the most iconic eras of English football. Unlock new clubs each season and decide whether to be a journeyman manager or a one-club hero.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/extras/dbdcc816c27b988303f74c9eb5c5e771.poster.avif?t=1760952389\" aria-label=\"GIF an old CRT television showcasing the Division 4 league table on a Teletext-like display. The player then scrolls through the pages using the TV&#039;s buttons, and clicks onto a news report about Exeter beating Brentford in a nervy showdown.\" width=800 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/extras/dbdcc816c27b988303f74c9eb5c5e771.webm?t=1760952389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/extras/dbdcc816c27b988303f74c9eb5c5e771.mp4?t=1760952389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590560?t=1760952389","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/8a48987b90fce7454114cd01e74cb7eb18a491bb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760952389","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/964b7261766a3a25657146aa5f805cc8da9a55f0/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1760952389","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/964b7261766a3a25657146aa5f805cc8da9a55f0/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1760952389","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4018930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deckbuilding goes in two-footed on football management!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the gaffer of a classic football team and embark on a nostalgic 20-year journey up and down the English football Divisions through the 1980s and 1990s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Game of Two Halves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your line-up and formations, and challenge the opposition in a fast-paced card battler with three points on the line in every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/extras/68c9bee4e3192af9177055d5a42c8466.poster.avif?t=1760952389\" aria-label=\"GIF showing part of a match. The player lays down a Heavy Press card on an action to tip the odds of a shot in the player&#039;s favour and score a goal.\" width=800 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/extras/68c9bee4e3192af9177055d5a42c8466.webm?t=1760952389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/extras/68c9bee4e3192af9177055d5a42c8466.mp4?t=1760952389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Move the Goalposts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only football game where getting cards is a good thing! Earn card packs by completing challenges. Combine cards to enhance your deck and bully the other team off the pitch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/extras/a54d7410c6ecd90d1a720eb42f089671.poster.avif?t=1760952389\" aria-label=\"GIF showcasing a hand of cards and the player combining two attacking cards to produce one stronger variant.\" width=800 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590560/extras/a54d7410c6ecd90d1a720eb42f089671.webm?t=1760952389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akama